duction Scala 3 toolchain setup — scala-cli, sbt, Coursier, mill, compiler phases, JVM bytecode mapping, and project scaffolding patterns used in real codebases.","md",{},"\u002Fscala\u002F01-getting-started",{"title":5,"description":1645},"scala\u002F01-getting-started","qXQo6IcAaSrIF5fWHBiiw2TekNPmP9En6LW8s8iRggE",1789747019728]